0 Rhizomorphs dimitic, spores 7.8-10.7 ??4.1-4.9 µm, finely rough to almost smooth in outline, ornament weakly cyanophilous to acyanophilous. Fruitbodies to 5 ??3 cm; Q =2.0-2.1. 0336467790 R. tsugina (Peck) Marr & Stuntz0
0 Spores 6.5-9 ??4-5.5 µm, Q = 1.6-1.8; rhizomorphs purple in 10% KOH; branches “salmon“ to “red brown“. Fruitbodies to 10 ??6 cm. 0346568800 R. rubella (Schaeff.) R.H. Petersen0
